    "final_answer": "I have gathered comprehensive search results. Let me record the findings:\n\n**Search Results for \"solar garden lights LED outdoor 10 pack\" - Over 20,000 results found**\n\nI've identified multiple products that match all the criteria (Solar-powered ✓, LED ✓, Minimum pack of 10 lights ✓, Under $50 ✓). Here are the top recommendations:\n\n## 🌟 Best Solar-Powered LED Garden Lights (10+ Pack, Under $50)\n\n### Top Pick - Best Seller & Highest Rated:\n1. **DenicMic Solar Lights Outdoor Waterproof 10 Pack Pathway Lights (Cool White)** - **$21.84** (List: $22.99)\n   - ⭐ 4.5/5 stars (9,844 ratings)\n   - 5K+ bought in past month\n   - Stainless steel pole, auto on/off 6000K LED\n   - *Best Seller in category*\n\n### Overall Pick:\n2. **Solar Pathway Lights Outdoor 10 Pack, LED Solar Garden Lights** - **$27.99** (List: $29.99)\n   - ⭐ 4.5/5 stars (169 ratings)\n   - 300+ bought in past month\n   - Auto on/off, waterproof, warm white available\n   - *Marked as \"Overall Pick\" by Amazon*\n\n### Best Deal - Limited Time:\n3. **10 Pack Ultra Bright Solar Lights Outdoor Waterproof** - **$27.98** (List: $46.29)\n   - ⭐ 4.6/5 stars (657 ratings)\n   - 500+ bought in past month\n   - Dusk to dawn, up to 12H lighting, auto on/off\n\n### Most Popular - High Volume:\n4. **GIGALUMI Solar Lights Outdoor Waterproof 10 Pack, LED Garden Decor** - **$22.99**\n   - ⭐ 4.1/5 stars (18,115 ratings)\n   - 50+ bought in past month\n   - Warm white LED, 8 hours lighting\n\n### Budget Choice:\n5. **10 Pack Solar Pathway Lights Outdoor Waterproof, Cool White LED** - **$19.99**\n   - ⭐ 4.5/5 stars (2,805 ratings)\n   - 500+ bought in past month\n   - Stainless steel stake lights, auto on/off\n\n### Premium Option (Under $50):\n6. **Solar Spot Lights Outdoor Waterproof, Solar Spotlights 10 Pack Cool White** - **$47.99**\n   - ⭐ 4.5/5 stars (139 ratings)\n   - 63 LED, 3 lighting modes\n\n## 🏆 My Recommendation:\n**DenicMic Solar Lights 10 Pack ($21.84)** is the best overall value - it's a Best Seller with nearly 10,000 ratings at 4.5 stars, well under your $50 budget, and includes 10 LED solar lights. Alternatively, **Solar Pathway Lights Outdoor 10 Pack by an \"Overall Pick\" brand ($27.99)** offers great features and Amazon's Overall Pick designation.\n\nAll listed products meet your criteria: ✅ Solar-powered ✅ LED ✅ 10+ lights per pack ✅ Under $50",
